      <p>Second recording (detailed run): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yFd3hN7mBGM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">watch it on YouTube</a></p>
      <p class="grid-note">Sampled at one frame per second. It is the one that shows the twelve-button panel and the fader recess most clearly (panel at 4:49, faders at 5:03); its on-screen clock runs at roughly double the video time. It is linked rather than embedded because the uploader has embedding switched off.</p>
